    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d65-a2">

                <pb facs="0133" n="53" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg53"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Satow to Mr. Squiers.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Legation</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Colleague</hi>: In reply to your inquiry of
                    the 16th instant relating to the provisional transfer of the old United States
                    concession to the municipality of the British extra concession, I beg herewith
                    to inclose copy of the terms on which I understand the above-mentioned
                    municipality are willing to agree. You will see that there is little or no
                    difference between these and the conditions forwarded to you by Mr. Ragsdale,
                    and I trust that an agreement may be come to which will prove beneficial to both
                    parties.</p>
                <p>Believe me, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ernest Satow.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
